+// Block-32 dequant: no WHT needed (graph handles rotation). Just centroid lookup + norm scale.
+// With QK_TURBO3=32: nl=2 for non-vec FA (32/16), nl=8 for vec FA (32/4).
+// Much less redundant work than block-128.
